@startuml FLEXT-gRPC Security Architecture

title FLEXT-gRPC Security Architecture and Threat Model

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

actor "Client Application" as client
participant "FLEXT-gRPC Client" as grpc_client
participant "mTLS Layer" as mtls
participant "Authentication" as auth
participant "Authorization" as authz
participant "FLEXT-gRPC Server" as grpc_server
participant "Business Logic" as business
database "Audit Log" as audit

== Authentication Flow ==
client -> grpc_client: Request with credentials
grpc_client -> mtls: Establish mTLS connection
mtls -> grpc_client: Mutual certificate validation

grpc_client -> auth: Validate client identity
auth -> grpc_client: Authentication result

alt Authentication successful
    grpc_client -> authz: Check permissions
    authz -> grpc_client: Authorization result
else Authentication failed
    grpc_client -> audit: Log authentication failure
    grpc_client --> client: UNAUTHENTICATED error
end

== Authorized Request Processing ==
grpc_client -> grpc_server: Forward authenticated request
grpc_server -> business: Process business logic
business -> grpc_server: Business result

grpc_server -> audit: Log successful operation
grpc_server --> grpc_client: Response with data

== Threat Mitigation Layers ==

note right of mtls
    **Transport Security**
    - Mutual TLS authentication
    - Certificate validation
    - Encrypted communication
    - Perfect forward secrecy
end note

note right of auth
    **Authentication Layer**
    - JWT token validation
    - Certificate-based auth
    - Multi-factor support
    - Session management
end note

note right of authz
    **Authorization Layer**
    - Role-based access control
    - Attribute-based permissions
    - Policy enforcement
    - Resource-level security
end note

note right of audit
    **Audit & Compliance**
    - Security event logging
    - Compliance reporting
    - Forensic analysis
    - Regulatory requirements
end note

== Security Controls Matrix ==

legend right
    |= Control Type |= Implementation |= Status |
    | Authentication | mTLS + JWT | ✅ Implemented |
    | Authorization | RBAC + ABAC | ⚠️ Planned |
    | Encryption | TLS 1.3 | ✅ Implemented |
    | Auditing | Structured logging | ✅ Implemented |
    | Input Validation | Pydantic models | ✅ Implemented |
    | Rate Limiting | Configurable limits | ⚠️ Planned |
endlegend

@enduml